# Visual QA (V2 product)

A page is not done when it compiles. Cycle:

`implement → run → open browser → interact → screenshot → review → fix → recheck`

Use `npx playwright-cli` from the repo (skill: `.cursor/skills/playwright-cli/SKILL.md`).

Product chrome = **V2** (`src/v2`). Compare screenshots to shipped V2 look + `DESIGN.md` (V3 sections are historical). If two pages look like different products, unify them toward V2.

Check: navigation, play, favorite, cart, filters, forms, checkout, admin tables, console errors, failed network.

Viewports: 1920, 1440, 1366, 1280, 1024, 768, 430, 390, 375. No accidental horizontal scroll. Player usable on mobile.

Fix obvious visual/interaction bugs yourself.
